    "source": {
      "value": "pc1"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Through an education in the arts or sheer dogged practice, you learned to entertain crowds. You might have been an actor, a dancer, a musician, a street magician, or any other sort of performer.\n\nChoose two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Charisma, and one is a free attribute boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Performance skill and the Theater Lore skill. You gain the Fascinating Performance skill feat."
    },
